  "body": "Tucked away down a private driveway in prestigious Bucklands Beach, this stunning three level residence offers an extraordinary blend of privacy, space, and modern comfort.\r\n\r\nLovingly updated and meticulously maintained by the same family for 28 years, the home is built with enduring quality featuring a solid concrete block base, cedar, and brick, as well as a concrete subfloor. Equipped with five heatpumps, it delivers effortless, year-round climate control.\r\n\r\n• Grand Main Living & Outdoor Flow: A double door foyer opens to formal and informal living spaces, alongside a dedicated office. The formal lounge, separate dining, and open plan kitchen and family room flow seamlessly out to an expansive, wrap-around deck with stainless steel balustrades, ideal for large scale entertaining or quiet evening BBQs set against sweeping water vistas. A further lower deck features a spa pool and entertaining area.\r\n\r\n• Modern Kitchen & Butler’s Pantry: Designed for effortless hosting, the updated kitchen boasts stone benchtops, premium appliances, and ocean views, complemented by a spacious butler’s pantry equipped with a sink and dedicated wine fridge.\r\n\r\n• Upper Level Master & Family Bedrooms: Ascend the circular staircase from the main lounge to the master retreat, complete with an ensuite and a private Juliet balcony overlooking the coast. Two additional bedrooms share a stylishly renovated family bathroom.\r\n\r\n• Versatile Lower-Level Living: The lower level features a fourth double bedroom, full bathroom, open-plan living room, storage room, and a wet bar/coffee station. Opening directly to a private patio and garden, this flexible floor plan provides the perfect setup for teenagers, extended family, or international students.\r\n\r\n• Garaging, Parking & Location: Includes a double garage with internal access, a large standalone storage shed, and ample parking for 4 cars. Positioned within walking distance of top schools - in-zone for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Primary, and Bucklands Beach Intermediate, local beaches, and a bus stop right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
